Package: motis.nng
Type: Package
Title: R Client for Local MOTIS via NNG IPC
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Description: Provides a high-performance R client for a local MOTIS instance
    using the 'nanonext' bindings to the NNG (Nanomsg Next Gen) lightweight
    messaging library. Communicates over NNG's request/reply protocol using
    an IPC (Unix domain socket / named pipe) transport.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.3.0)
Imports:
    nanonext,
    jsonlite
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
